OL,3,CJordan Henderson has successful wrist
OL,4,Csurgery after Mexico fall
OL,6,FJordan Henderson has undergone
OL,7,Fsuccessful surgery in Kansas City
OL,8,Fafter he suffered a wrist injury in
OL,9,Fthe aftermath of England's win against
OL,10,FMexico.
OL,12,FThe 36-year-old sustained the nasty
OL,13,Finjury when he fell and landed
OL,14,Fawkwardly while climbing back over the
OL,15,Fadvertising hoardings during the
OL,16,Fcelebrations of the 3-2 success at the
OL,17,FAzteca.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/5
