PN,31202
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1783752523
OL,3,CJordan Henderson has successful wrist
OL,4,Csurgery after Mexico fall
OL,6,FHe was carried away on a stretcher and
OL,7,Ftaken to hospital in the Mexican
OL,8,Fcapital while the rest of the team
OL,9,Freturned to their Kansas City base.
OL,11,FThe Brentford midfielder went under
OL,12,Fthe knife once he returned to the
OL,13,FMidwest as he began his road to
OL,14,Frecovery.
OL,16,F"Surgery done! Let's get ready for the
OL,17,Fbig one Saturday," he posted on
OL,18,FInstagram on Wednesday.
OL,26,@xD@AOUyD@RO]
