PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1783752523
OL,3,CJordan Henderson has successful wrist
OL,4,Csurgery after Mexico fall
OL,6,F"Thank you to all the staff that
OL,7,Flooked after me at Kansas City
OL,8,Forthopaedic institute. Especially the
OL,9,Fthree surgeons who carried out the
OL,10,Foperation."
OL,12,FHenderson's tournament appears to be
OL,13,Fover from a playing side, but the
OL,14,Fveteran, who is at his fourth World
OL,15,FCup and made a substitute appearance
OL,16,Fin the 2-0 win over Panama, is
OL,17,Fexpected to stay in camp for the
OL,18,Fremainder of England's journey.
OL,26,@nD@AOUrD@KO]
