OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F312A1783752523
OL,3,CJordan Henderson has successful wrist
OL,4,Csurgery after Mexico fall
OL,6,FThomas Tuchel's men returned to
OL,7,Ftraining on Wednesday as they step up
OL,8,Fpreparations for Saturday's quarter-
OL,9,Ffinal with Norway in Miami.
OL,11,FTeammate Morgan Rogers said
OL,12,FHenderson's determination to stay with
OL,13,Fthe team shows "just shows exactly
OL,14,Fwhat he's like as a person, as a guy,
OL,15,Fand I think hopefully he can be still
OL,16,Finvolved with us going through the
OL,17,Frest of the tournament."
OL,19,F"He's not going to rule himself out
OL,20,Fand neither are we," he continued.
OL,26,@{D@AOU
